:: Fishing Moor Hiker Flirt Back Off
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_hiker_1">><<person1>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.hikers.phase to "finished">>
The <<person1>><<person>>'s smile fades. <<He>> stands and steps toward you. "You're going to tease me like that, and then do nothing? That's not happening."<<gstress>><<stress 5>>
<br><br>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"I — sorry, I didn't mean to—" you stammer, backing away. "Please don't—"
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
