:: Fishing Moor Spiked Drink 1
<<drugs 180>>

You set the can down and something feels wrong almost immediately, a warmth that spreads too fast, a faint blur creeping in at the edges of your vision.
<br><br>

You blink. The moor looks further away than it should, and the sound of the water is oddly distant. Your legs feel unreliable beneath you. Why is the ground moving towards you?
<br><br>

<<link [[...|Fishing Moor Spiked Drink 2]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Spiked Drink 2
<<bind>>
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_hiker_1">><<person1>>
<<loadNPC 1 "moor_hiker_2">><<person2>>

You come to on the ground. Heather pressed against your cheek. Your wrists are bound behind you. You try to rise, but can't manage it. Your head is heavy, thoughts slow and thick.
<br><br>

The <<group>> stands over you, grinning. "Thought that'd take longer." "What an idiot." They advance on you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Spiked Drink Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Spiked Drink Molestation
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<set $enemyno to 2>>
	<<set $enemynomax to 2>>
	<<maninit>>
	<<hawkRescueSetup>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<alarmstate>>
<<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>

<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Spiked Drink Molestation Finish]]>><</link>></span>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Spiked Drink Molestation]]>><</link>></span>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Moor Spiked Drink Molestation Finish
<<effects>>
<<set $fishing.fishingMoor.event to "none">>
<<set $fishing.fishingMoor.eventDanger to 0>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.hikers.phase to "finished">>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	<<tearful>> you get to your feet and glance around. The heather all looks the same. <span class="red">You have no idea how deep in the moor you are,</span> and your rod is long gone. <<handheldruined>>
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<set $moor to Math.max(90, $moor + random(5, 15) * 3)>>
	<<clearNPC "moor_hiker_1">>
	<<clearNPC "moor_hiker_2">>

	<<link [[Next|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $alarm is 1 and $rescue is 1>>
	The <<group>> begin to curse as a <<hawkScreechDesc>> pierces the air. <<hawkRescueApproachSentence>>
	<br><br>

	The <<group>>, panicked, scatter in different directions, disappearing into the moor.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">><<person1>>
	<<tearful>> you search the heavens for <<if $syndromebird is 1>>your <<if $monster is 1>><<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">><<else>>partner<</if>><<else>>whatever your assailant saw<</if>>. You quickly find what you're looking for, seeing <<if $syndromebird is 1>>your<<else>>a<</if>> <<beasttype>> flying towards you as fast as <<bhis>> wings can carry <<bhim>>.
	<br><br>

	<<clearNPC "moor_hiker_1">>
	<<clearNPC "moor_hiker_2">>

	<<if $syndromebird is 1>>
		<<link [[Next|Bird Rescue Syndrome]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Next|Bird Rescue No Syndrome]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	You manage to push one of them off. In the confusion you scramble upright and run, no direction, just away. The drug makes everything lurch and blur.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you run until the sounds behind you are gone, until there's nothing but heather and wind. The moor looks the same in every direction. <span class="red">You have no idea where you are,</span> and your rod is long gone. <<handheldruined>>
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<set $moor to Math.max(90, $moor + random(2, 5) * 5)>>
	<<clearNPC "moor_hiker_1">>
	<<clearNPC "moor_hiker_2">>

	<<link [[Next|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Moor Hiker Drink Offer
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_hiker_1">><<person1>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.hikers.drinkOffered to true>>
As you watch the surface of the water for movement, the <<person1>><<person>> reaches into the bag and pulls out a pair of cans and passes one to <<his>> companion. <<He>> grabs one more and holds it out toward you. "Want one?"
<br><br>

<<link [[Accept|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><<endevent>><<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.hikers.drinkCount to 10>><<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.hikers.drinkOffered to true>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Decline|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


